# AccidentGuard Environment Configuration

# Optional: Google Maps API Key
# If set, AccidentGuard unlocks official Google Maps JavaScript API, 
# live Directions routing to trauma centers, and Google Places search.
# If omitted or left empty, AccidentGuard automatically uses free Leaflet/OpenStreetMap.
# You can also enter and save this key directly inside the app in Settings > Maps & APIs.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
